{:edb/db-before-t 814 :edb/db-after-t 815 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534127 50 #inst "2026-10-06T04:04:30.375Z" 13194139534127 true] [17592186105401 1100 "Suppose that $\\mid \\,\\mathbf{a}\\,|=8, \\mid \\,\\mathbf{b}\\,|=4$ and that the angle between the vectors is $\\theta = \\dfrac{5\\pi}{6}$. Find the vector projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}$ in terms of the vector $\\mathbf{b}$." 13194139534127 false] [17592186105401 1100 "Suppose that $|\\,\\mathbf{a}\\,|=8,|\\,\\mathbf{b}\\,|=4$ and that the angle between the vectors is $\\theta = \\dfrac{5\\pi}{6}.$ Find the vector projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}$ in terms of the vector $\\mathbf{b}.$" 13194139534127 true] [17592186105401 1145 "First, we find the scalar projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ncomp_{b}a &= \\mid a \\mid \\cos θ \\\\\n&= 8\\cos (\\frac{5π}{6}) \\\\\n&= 8 \\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\\n&=-4\\sqrt{3}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the unit vector that is parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u} = \\dfrac{\\mathbf{b}}{\\mid \\,\\mathbf{b}\\, \\mid} = \\dfrac{\\mathbf{b}}{4} = \\dfrac{1}{4} \\mathbf{b}\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute the vector projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nproj_{b}a &= comp_{b}a \\cdot u \\\\\n&=-4\\sqrt{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{4}b \\\\\n&=-\\sqrt{3}b\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534127 false] [17592186105401 1145 "First, we find the scalar projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =|\\,a\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =8\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =8\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\  & =-4\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the unit vector that is parallel to $\\mathbf{b}\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u} = \\dfrac{\\mathbf{b}}{|\\,\\mathbf{b}\\,|} = \\dfrac{\\mathbf{b}}{4} = \\dfrac{1}{4} \\mathbf{b}\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute the vector projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & ={\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a\\cdot u \\\\  & =-4\\sqrt{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}b \\\\  & =-\\sqrt{3}b\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534127 true] [17592186105402 1145 "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nproj_{b}a &= \\frac{a \\cdot b}{b \\cdot b}b \\\\\n&= \\frac{a_{x}b_{x} + a_{y}b_{y} + a_{z}b_{z}}{b_{x}^{2} + b_{y}^{2} + b_{z}^{2}}b \\\\\n&= (1 \\cdot 5 + (-3) \\cdot (-4) + 5 \\cdot 0)/(5^{2} + (-4)^{2} + 0^{2})b \\\\\n&= \\frac{17}{41}⟨5,-4, 0⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨\\frac{85}{41},-\\frac{68}{41}, 0⟩\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534127 false] [17592186105402 1145 "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{b\\cdot b}b \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 5+(-3)\\cdot (-4)+5\\cdot 0}{{5}^{2}+(-4)^{2}+{0}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{17}{41}⟨5,-4,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{85}{41},-\\frac{68}{41},0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534127 true] [17592186105403 1100 "Let $[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$. Find the vector projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}$." 13194139534127 true] [17592186105403 1100 "Let $\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$ and $\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$. Find the vector projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}$." 13194139534127 false] [17592186105403 1145 "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nproj_{b}a &= \\frac{a \\cdot b}{b \\cdot b}b \\\\\n&= \\frac{a_{x}b_{x} + a_{y}b_{y} + a_{z}b_{z}}{b_{x}^{2} + b_{y}^{2} + b_{z}^{2}}b \\\\\n&= (1 \\cdot 1 + 0 \\cdot 5 + 1 \\cdot (-1))/(1^{2} + 5^{2} + (-1)^{2})b \\\\\n&= (0)/(1^{2} + 5^{2} + (-1)^{2})b \\\\\n&= ⟨0, 0, 0⟩\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534127 false] [17592186105403 1145 "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{b\\cdot b}b \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 5+1\\cdot (-1)}{{1}^{2}+{5}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{{1}^{2}+{5}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}b \\\\  & =⟨0,0,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534127 true] [17592186105625 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278152 13194139534127 true] [17592186105625 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278166 13194139534127 true] [17592186105625 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278196 13194139534127 true] [17592186105625 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278210 13194139534127 true] [17592186105625 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278217 13194139534127 true] [17592186105626 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278131 13194139534127 true] [17592186105626 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278138 13194139534127 true] [17592186105626 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278145 13194139534127 true] [17592186105626 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278170 13194139534127 true] [17592186105626 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278178 13194139534127 true] [17592186105627 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278159 13194139534127 true] [17592186105627 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278185 13194139534127 true] [17592186105627 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278192 13194139534127 true] [17592186105627 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278199 13194139534127 true] [17592186105627 1020 #edb/ref 17592186278202 13194139534127 true] [17592186278131 1017 #edb/ref 17592186278132 13194139534127 true] [17592186278131 1089 "q-126507" 13194139534127 true] [17592186278131 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534127 true] [17592186278131 1100 "Let $a=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 3\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}]$ and $b=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$ Find the vector projection of $b$ onto $a.$" 13194139534127 true] [17592186278131 1113 #uuid "07d400bc-8e75-529a-86cf-3fbedf09676f" 13194139534127 true] [17592186278131 1145 "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{a\\cdot a}a \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}a \\\\  &